  "ingredients": [
    "4 tablespoons butter, divided",
    "4 cloves garlic",
    "2 tablespoons lemon juice",
    "0.25 teaspoon onion powder",
    "4 (8 ounce) skin-on, bone-in chicken thighs",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "2 tablespoons fresh parsley, chopped"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Place 3 tablespoons butter in a microwave-safe bowl and heat in a microwave oven until melted, 1 to 2 minutes. Smash garlic cloves with the side of a chef's knife and add garlic to the warm butter. Stir in lemon juice and onion powder; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cQjhkHOucLDYDOgL6Dd_58XMpt0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/272544-Baked-Lemon-Butter-Chicken-Thighs-ddmfs-140-step1-2b607f8c995b4adc858403eb8b12d205.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272544/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle both sides of chicken thighs with salt and pepper. Heat remaining 1 tablespoon butter in a medium oven-safe skillet over medium-high heat. Brown chicken, skin-side down, for 3 to 4 minutes. Flip chicken over and brush skin with lemon-butter mixture. Pour remaining butter mixture into skillet and remove from heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cmv2tm3bmEIOSlA8cu_-Il-QRuA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/272544-Baked-Lemon-Butter-Chicken-Thighs-ddmfs-141-step2-2a68529e76f34bbf96e4dc1988f9dda7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272544/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until chicken is no longer pink at the bone and the juices run clear, about 30 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted near the bone should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C). Brush skin every 10 minutes with pan juices.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YtA8_XeK-fueuR9vjDHaXH914Os=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/272544-Baked-Lemon-Butter-Chicken-Thighs-ddmfs-142-step3-8b067445689647c1a379ddab5686c2a4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272544/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove skillet from the oven and place chicken on a serving platter. Drizzle chicken with pan juices and garnish with parsley.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    }
  ],
